tion><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span>具体安排及注意事项通知如下：</span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>活动报名时间：</span><span><strong><span>2026年7月1日~7月10日</span></strong></span></p><p><span>活动时间：</span><span><strong><span>2026年7月20日-21日</span></strong></span></p><p><span>参加人数：</span><span><strong><span>约60名（不含上海财经大学计算机与人工智能学院本科生）</span></strong></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>01</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>活动内容（拟定）</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><ol><li><p><span>举行活动开幕式；</span></p></li><li><p><span>参加学术讲座，相关研究方向专任教师学术报告；</span></p></li><li><p><span>参观我校档案馆和重点实验室等；</span></p></li><li><p><span>破冰团建活动等，打破参与者之间的陌生感，促进后续交流；</span></p></li><li><p><span>导师交流面对面，为参与者提供与学院专家、教授、优秀研究生近距离交流的机会，解答学术疑问、科研困惑、就业规划等问题，深化学术认知。</span></p></li></ol></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>02</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请条件</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><ol><li><p><span>拥护中国共产党领导，愿为祖国建设服务，品德良好，遵纪守法。</span></p></li><li><p><span>全国高校大学优秀本科三年级在校生，且满足以下条件：</span></p></li></ol><ul><li><p><span>学习成绩优异；</span></p></li><li><p><span>学术研究兴趣浓厚，具有较强的创新意识、创新能力和专业能力倾向，如本科期间作为主要作者有高质量论文发表；</span></p></li><li><p><span>诚实守信，学风端正，未受过任何处分，不存在任何有违学术道德、专业伦理等行为；</span></p></li><li><p><span>身心健康，有志于学术研究工作；</span></p></li><li><p><span>英语水平良好。</span></p></li></ul></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>03</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>报名方式及申请材料</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>请于</span><strong><span>7月1日~7月10日</span></strong><span>扫描下方二维码报名并提交报名申请材料，并将申请材料同步发送至邮箱scaiyjsjw@mail.shufe.edu.cn</span><strong><span>（</span></strong><strong><span>邮件主题：学校名+姓名+ SCAI学术交流活动申请），报名截止日期：</span></strong><span><strong><span>2026年7月10日17:00</span></strong></span><span>。</span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/SnQgiaUea2DF2AYibWp3E0sffiaRiaqwucNjPvLx4yicufoU7tySgM4k1feqbZOD4jH6x6nTn4pqMPhaJMhIfCzXUiaHnBODKezIiarSCa5Bjc56Uw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span>问卷链接：https://www.wjx.top/vm/OkZI2xp.aspx</span></p></section><section><p><span>上传申请材料包括：</span></p><ol><li><p><span>个人简历；</span></p></li><li><p><span>专家推荐信2封PDF彩色扫描件，需要2位副教授（含）以上老师分别推荐（</span><span><span>点击阅读原文可下载模版</span></span><span>）；</span></p></li><li><p><span>本科阶段前五个学期成绩单PDF彩色扫描件；</span></p></li><li><p><span>英语成绩证明（国家大学英语六级考试成绩等材料）PDF彩色扫描件；</span></p></li><li><p><span>身份证PDF彩色扫描件（正反面需在ー页上，身份证在有效期内）；</span></p></li><li><p><span>学生证PDF彩色扫描件（包含照片及个人信息页）；</span></p></li><li><p><span>《教育部学籍在线验证报告》PDF版；</span></p></li><li><p><span>其他证明材料（如已发表论文及各类奖状及证书等）PDF彩色扫描件。</span></p></li><li><p><span>以上1-8材料严格按照顺序做成一个pdf，并在首页附上目录。</span></p></li></ol><p><span>申请人必须保证提交的申请信息及全部申请材料的真实性和准确性。对存在弄虚作假、有违学术道德和专业伦理等不当行为的，一经查实即取消申请资格。</span></p><p><span>本次学术交流开放日活动不收取报名费用。</span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>04</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>其他事项</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>入选学生名单将在7月中旬前发布在计算机与人工智能学院官方网站，并通过电话和邮件通知本人。届时未接到录取通知的同学皆为未入选者，不再另行通知。</span></p><p><span>如录取者因个人原因不能参加本次活动，应及时告知我院，以便对其他同学候补参与。</span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/SnQgiaUea2DHgsxEib1DV624vYNPLNMzrqwrj4ZTRPJeyyicXs4X5qEXmbPmW8OkLghqkBX3ZhtVNET5j99MNZjVS9VeNPQAu5f2Dp5iayK6ibpM/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>联系方式</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><section><p><span>上海财经大学计算机与人工智能学院</span></p><p><span>电话：021-65901001</span></p><p><span>联系人：张老师</span></p><p><span>邮件：scaiyjsjw@mail.shufe.edu.cn</span></p><p><span>网址：https://scai.sufe.edu.cn</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><sect